WEBVTT

2
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:13.700
Start with a few atoms: small operations you choose.

3
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:23.700
Substitution: a new operator is written with the atoms.

4
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:32.700
Choice: a test picks which case to use.

5
00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:43.700
Recursion: an operator calls itself until a base case.

6
00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:56.700
Each layer builds on the ones below. Concepts without limit.

7
00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:06.700
Every step is checked by the interpreter.

8
00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:18.700
Six ways to test reasoning.

9
00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:29.700
The same structure works in any world.
